The dot plot shows fern heights. What is the range?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large},scale=0.8]
\draw[->] (-0.5,0)--(8.8,0); \foreach \x in {0,...,8} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {$\x$};} \foreach \x/\c in {1/1,2/2,4/4,6/2,8/1} {\foreach \k in {1,...,\c} {\fill (\x,{0.34*\k}) circle (2.2pt);}} \node[below] at (4.5,-0.9) {Height (cm)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The dot plot shows petals on flowers. What is the mode?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large},scale=0.8]
\draw[->] (-0.5,0)--(8.8,0); \foreach \x in {0,...,8} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {$\x$};} \foreach \x/\c in {2/1,3/3,4/2,6/5,7/2,8/1} {\foreach \k in {1,...,\c} {\fill (\x,{0.34*\k}) circle (2.2pt);}} \node[below] at (5,-0.9) {Number of petals};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Compare the ranges of the two watering trials.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large},scale=0.78]
\draw[->] (-0.5,0)--(8.8,0); \draw[->] (-0.5,2.3)--(8.8,2.3); \foreach \x in {0,...,8} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {$\x$}; \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,2.3) {$\x$};} \foreach \x/\c in {2/1,3/2,4/3,6/1} {\foreach \k in {1,...,\c} {\fill (\x,{0.32*\k}) circle (2.2pt);}} \foreach \x/\c in {0/1,2/2,5/3,8/1} {\foreach \k in {1,...,\c} {\fill (\x,{2.3+0.32*\k}) circle (2.2pt);}} \node[left] at (-0.55,0.8) {Trial A}; \node[left] at (-0.55,3.1) {Trial B}; \node[below] at (4,-0.9) {Daily growth (mm)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Which statement correctly compares the modes?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large},scale=0.78]
\draw[->] (-0.5,0)--(7.8,0); \draw[->] (-0.5,2.3)--(7.8,2.3); \foreach \x in {0,...,7} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {$\x$}; \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,2.3) {$\x$};} \foreach \x/\c in {1/1,2/4,4/2,6/1} {\foreach \k in {1,...,\c} {\fill (\x,{0.32*\k}) circle (2.2pt);}} \foreach \x/\c in {1/1,3/2,5/4,7/1} {\foreach \k in {1,...,\c} {\fill (\x,{2.3+0.32*\k}) circle (2.2pt);}} \node[left] at (-0.55,0.8) {Batch C}; \node[left] at (-0.55,3.1) {Batch D}; \node[below] at (4,-0.9) {Seedling leaves};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The two displays have the same mode. Which statement about their ranges is also true?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large},scale=0.78]
\draw[->] (-0.5,0)--(8.8,0); \draw[->] (-0.5,2.3)--(8.8,2.3); \foreach \x in {0,...,8} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {$\x$}; \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,2.3) {$\x$};} \foreach \x/\c in {2/1,3/2,4/4,5/2,6/1} {\foreach \k in {1,...,\c} {\fill (\x,{0.32*\k}) circle (2.2pt);}} \foreach \x/\c in {1/1,2/2,4/5,7/2,8/1} {\foreach \k in {1,...,\c} {\fill (\x,{2.3+0.32*\k}) circle (2.2pt);}} \node[left] at (-0.55,0.8) {Patch E}; \node[left] at (-0.55,3.1) {Patch F}; \node[below] at (4.5,-0.9) {Plant height (cm)};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
